RcppOptimLib bundles the header-only version (generated upstream via
./configure --header-only-version) of the following libraries in
inst/include/, with two mechanical modifications required for use
inside R (documented in IMPLEMENTATION.md in the source repository):
index-vector typedefs changed to arma::uword, and console output
(std::cout / printf) routed through Rcpp::Rcout / Rprintf per CRAN
policy:

  - OptimLib      (https://github.com/kthohr/optim)
  - BaseMatrixOps (https://github.com/kthohr/BaseMatrixOps),
    a submodule of OptimLib, in inst/include/BaseMatrixOps/

Both are Copyright (c) 2016-2023 Keith O'Hara and distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. See inst/include/optimlib-LICENSE and
inst/include/optimlib-NOTICE.txt for the full license text and notices.

OptimLib's headers use include paths relative to the library root
(e.g. "misc/optim_structs.hpp"), which is why they sit directly in
inst/include/ rather than in a subdirectory.

